    <content>&lt;b&gt;Journal of Operations Management&lt;/b&gt; &lt;br&gt;RETRACTION:E.C.Falcone,T.Yan, andB.S.Fugate, “,”Journal of Operations Management70, no.  (2024):979–1006,https://doi.org/10.1002/joom.1319.The above article, published online on 9 June 2024 in Wiley Online Library (http://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/), has been retracted by agreement between the authors; the journal Editors‐in‐Chief, Elliot Bendoly and Rogelio Oliva; the Association for Supply Chain Management; and Wiley Periodicals LLC. The authors contacted the journal editors regarding numerous unintentional errors in the reporting and documentation of the published analyses, which they identified after publication. As the editors consider that these errors are too extensive to be remedied through correction, the article must therefore be retracted. The authors agree with this decision and regret these errors.</content>
